# Common — Quality Gates & Definition of Done

## Quality Gates (Hard Requirement)

All must pass before merge:

- Linting
- Formatting
- Unit tests
- Integration tests (if applicable)
- Type checking (if applicable)
- Security scan (SAST + dependency)
- Human approval
- CI success

No exceptions without documented approval.

## Definition of Done

A task is DONE only when:

- Code merged via PR
- CI passed
- Tests exist (unit + integration where applicable)
- Docs updated (if needed)
- Monitoring updated (if needed)
- Rollback possible
- Security checks passed
- Feature works
- Logs are meaningful
